  "about": "The locked colour set of the pixel world: material ramps, dark to light. An art asset, read by tools/world-art (never by UI code). Metal ramps (bronze, iron, steel, mithril) are for worked metal: gear, tools, item icons. Accent ramps (torch, blood, frost, venom, gold) are for light, magic, loot and blood only. Widening a ramp is a deliberate act: bump id and rebuild every set.",
